{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00482",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.12,
      "end_seconds": 6.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "Doctor, this one's ready for you. Everything's on the chart, but I'll go through it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.8,
      "end_seconds": 10.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.44,
      "end_seconds": 19.96,
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "text": "I've been dealing with fever with chills. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.5,
      "end_seconds": 23.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.77,
      "end_seconds": 32.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "Right, uh, ever since... since yesterday, really. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.04,
      "end_seconds": 34.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "How often does it happen?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.98,
      "end_seconds": 38.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Honestly, a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.93,
      "end_seconds": 43.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "What about terrible shaking and sweating, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.94,
      "end_seconds": 45.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.81,
      "end_seconds": 48.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Okay, any nausea as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.15,
      "end_seconds": 51.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Mm, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.66,
      "end_seconds": 60.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "So, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.04,
      "end_seconds": 74.56,
      "duration_seconds": 13.52,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly. I'd say once or twice a day. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. I've also been feeling very weak, since this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.35,
      "end_seconds": 77.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.01,
      "end_seconds": 78.83,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.89,
      "end_seconds": 95.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any breathlessness, diarrhoea or stiff neck at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.77,
      "end_seconds": 99.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Right, you know, nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.14,
      "end_seconds": 101.1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Any rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.49,
      "end_seconds": 103.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "No, uh, no rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.47,
      "end_seconds": 107.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.86,
      "end_seconds": 113.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.68,
      "end_seconds": 118.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.51,
      "end_seconds": 122.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Okay, so I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 124.0,
      "end_seconds": 135.01,
      "duration_seconds": 11.01,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Temp 38.3 degrees, pulse is 92 beats a minute, respiratory rate 19, pressure 113 over 73, SpO2 95 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.41,
      "end_seconds": 140.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Right, good, thank you. Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.47,
      "end_seconds": 142.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.24,
      "end_seconds": 145.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.2,
      "end_seconds": 147.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "No, nothing regular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.94,
      "end_seconds": 162.49,
      "duration_seconds": 14.55,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.9,
      "end_seconds": 168.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "I mean, good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.17,
      "end_seconds": 171.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.75,
      "end_seconds": 177.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Hmm, my brother has asthma. My mother has diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.85,
      "end_seconds": 181.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.8,
      "end_seconds": 191.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.46,
      "text": "I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.62,
      "end_seconds": 194.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.08,
      "end_seconds": 201.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "I mean, yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.96,
      "end_seconds": 205.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.97,
      "end_seconds": 214.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "Yes, COPD. Okay, so I've had low haemoglobin, yes. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.04,
      "end_seconds": 225.88,
      "duration_seconds": 10.84,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known COPD. We'll keep that in mind today. Okay, low haemoglobin, that's already on your record. Good to know. Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.15,
      "end_seconds": 239.47,
      "duration_seconds": 12.32,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.01,
      "end_seconds": 244.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.47,
      "end_seconds": 248.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.37,
      "end_seconds": 265.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "No rash anywhere on your body that I can see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.66,
      "end_seconds": 270.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Turn your head to the side for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.88,
      "end_seconds": 283.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Your spleen tip is just palpable under the ribs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.24,
      "end_seconds": 285.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.83,
      "end_seconds": 301.93,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.44,
      "end_seconds": 306.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.05,
      "end_seconds": 307.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.57,
      "end_seconds": 330.42,
      "duration_seconds": 11.85,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Putting it all together, my working impression is malaria until proven otherwise. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I can't rule out dengue fever yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.99,
      "end_seconds": 337.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "I've, I've been thinking the worst, um, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.5,
      "end_seconds": 350.97,
      "duration_seconds": 12.47,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with malaria until proven otherwise do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had fever with chills, since yesterday, and no diarrhoea or rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 351.38,
      "end_seconds": 353.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.94,
      "end_seconds": 356.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.18,
      "end_seconds": 362.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.19,
      "end_seconds": 374.71,
      "duration_seconds": 10.52,
      "text": "I'm going to order a dengue test, for fever. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'm going to order blood tests, for fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.88,
      "end_seconds": 377.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.29,
      "end_seconds": 395.19,
      "duration_seconds": 14.9,
      "text": "I'd like you to take paracetamol, 500 milligrams, every six hours if needed, for three days. That should help with fever and body aches. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.71,
      "end_seconds": 398.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 399.95,
      "end_seconds": 419.02,
      "duration_seconds": 19.07,
      "text": "Let the lab know you travelled recently, that's important for the tests. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. Please don't sit on it if you get confused, very drowsy, or the shaking returns. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 419.51,
      "end_seconds": 421.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 421.99,
      "end_seconds": 423.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Let's review you in two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 425.31,
      "end_seconds": 426.01,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 427.56,
      "end_seconds": 434.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 434.78,
      "end_seconds": 444.23,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "So, I take the paracetamol, 500 milligrams, every six hours if needed and come back in two days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 445.34,
      "end_seconds": 451.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's all I have. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 452.4,
      "end_seconds": 455.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Uh, thank you. I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}